---
layout: base.njk
title: AI Forecast Calendar
---
<header>
  <p class="eyebrow">AI Forecast Calendar</p>
  <h1>Predicted futures,<br>on an ordinary calendar.</h1>
  <p class="intro">Published AI forecasts can feel abstract. This project turns their dated milestones into portable calendar feeds, so they can sit alongside the rest of your life.</p>
</header>
<section aria-labelledby="calendars-heading">
  <h2 id="calendars-heading">Available calendars</h2>
  {% if forecasts.length %}
    <ol class="calendar-list">
      {% for forecast in forecasts %}
        <li>
          <div><h3>{{ forecast.title }}</h3><p>{{ forecast.description }}</p></div>
          <div class="actions"><a href="{{ ('/calendars/' + forecast.id + '.ics') | url }}">Download .ics</a><a href="{{ forecast.source_url }}">Original source</a></div>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty">The first curated forecast calendar is in preparation.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
<footer><p>A faithful presentation layer for published forecasts—not a new forecast.</p></footer>
